    us, you agree to them.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Our products</h2>
    <p>
      Many of our pieces are one of a kind, so an item shown online may sell in the store before your order goes through. We
      try to show colors, sizes and condition accurately, but photos and screens vary. Prices and availability can change
      without notice, and we may correct mistakes in listings.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Orders and payment</h2>
    <p>
      Online checkout is run by Shopify, and payment is taken when you place your order. If an item turns out to be
      unavailable, we'll contact you and refund what you paid for it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Returns and exchanges</h2>
    <p>All sales are final. Exchanges are covered by our <a href="/return-policy/">Return Policy</a>.</p>
