  <section id="sms-terms">
    <h2>Text message terms</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Sunny &amp; Ranney Schedule Texts</strong> sends our own employees their work schedule. We do not text customers
      or the public.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Signing up:</strong> an employee gives their mobile number to the store manager and agrees in writing to
        receive schedule texts. The first text confirms the sign-up.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>What you'll get:</strong> your shifts when a week's schedule is published, and a text if your shifts change.
        Usually one or two texts a week.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Cost:</strong> message and data rates may apply. Sunny &amp; Ranney does not charge for texts.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Stopping:</strong> reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any text to cancel. You'll get one confirmation and no more
        messages. Reply <strong>START</strong> to sign up again.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Help:</strong> reply <strong>HELP</strong>, call <a href="tel:6788885140">678.888.5140</a> or email
        <a href="mailto:info@sunnyandranney.com">info@sunnyandranney.com</a>.
      </li>
      <li>Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
      <li>
        We do not share mobile numbers or text consent with third parties for marketing. See the
        <a href="/privacy/#text-messages">Text messages</a> section of our Privacy Policy.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

